    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrenaline or Die</strong> \u2013 a high-speed action slasher with kicks and destruction where you\u2019ll never want to stop! <strong>No health\u2014only adrenaline.</strong>\u00a0Mystic force has infected our world. The gods can no longer protect their people\u2014<strong>now it\u2019s all up to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whoever caused this catastrophe\u2026 will answer for it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kicks and Destructible Environments.</strong> It's not just flashy\u2014it's effective! Slam enemies into concrete with your foot, grab debris, and hurl it at the rest! More <strong>ADRENALINE</strong> = more possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/bcc0b137aaea7937015626151d8190a9.poster.avif?t=1750695406\" width=774 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/bcc0b137aaea7937015626151d8190a9.webm?t=1750695406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/bcc0b137aaea7937015626151d8190a9.mp4?t=1750695406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No health \u2014 only ADRENALINE.</strong> While it's high, you're immortal! But it drains fast: taking hits or staying idle lowers it. Let it drop too far \u2014 and you're dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/05c2c968839e27dc162f4dd4fad47714.poster.avif?t=1750695406\" width=774 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/05c2c968839e27dc162f4dd4fad47714.webm?t=1750695406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/05c2c968839e27dc162f4dd4fad47714.mp4?t=1750695406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities in exchange for ADRENALINE. </strong>Run. Fight. Destroy. Keep ADRENALINE high to unlock devastating powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/70238105eef124696df7194f92537adc.poster.avif?t=1750695406\" width=774 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/70238105eef124696df7194f92537adc.webm?t=1750695406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/70238105eef124696df7194f92537adc.mp4?t=1750695406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kick the ass of the Architect of the Universe!</strong> He shielded your people from all dangers, yet you must live and die on schedule. Your time is set\u2014the end in 40 days, no more, no less. Isn\u2019t this the perfect chance to settle the score with him?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adrenaline or Die</strong> \u2013 a high-speed action slasher with kicks and destruction where you\u2019ll never want to stop! <strong>No health\u2014only adrenaline.</strong>\u00a0Mystic force has infected our world. The gods can no longer protect their people\u2014<strong>now it\u2019s all up to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Whoever caused this catastrophe\u2026 will answer for it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kicks and Destructible Environments.</strong> It's not just flashy\u2014it's effective! Slam enemies into concrete with your foot, grab debris, and hurl it at the rest! More <strong>ADRENALINE</strong> = more possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/bcc0b137aaea7937015626151d8190a9.poster.avif?t=1750695406\" width=774 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/bcc0b137aaea7937015626151d8190a9.webm?t=1750695406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/bcc0b137aaea7937015626151d8190a9.mp4?t=1750695406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No health \u2014 only ADRENALINE.</strong> While it's high, you're immortal! But it drains fast: taking hits or staying idle lowers it. Let it drop too far \u2014 and you're dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806200/extras/05c2c968839e27dc162f4dd4fad47714.poster.avif?t=1750695406\" width=774 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a